           "worked": "$P$ is $\\frac{3}{4}$ of the distance from $A$ to $B$.\n$$\\begin{aligned}x_P&=1+\\frac{3}{4}(9-1)\\\\x_P&=7\\\\y_P&=2+\\frac{3}{4}(10-2)\\\\y_P&=8\\end{aligned}$$"
