     "nodeId": "p3-formula-content",
     "replacement": "The **midpoint** $M$ of the interval joining $(x_1,y_1)$ and $(x_2,y_2)$ has coordinates equal to the means of the endpoint coordinates:\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}M&=(\\text{mean of }x,\\text{mean of }y)\\\\M&=\\left(\\frac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\frac{y_1+y_2}{2}\\right)\\end{aligned}$$",
     "autoApply": true,
     "key": "theory|p3-formula",
     "targetFingerprint": "e9a55f85fb79815b1873f309cf4afae3e0ef586455fe02d55667170a1d8e02c3",
