     "nodeId": "p8-formula-text",
     "replacement": "The **gradient** $m$ of the line through $(x_1,y_1)$ and $(x_2,y_2)$, where $x_1\\ne x_2$, is the rise divided by the run:\n\n$$m=\\frac{\\text{rise}}{\\text{run}}$$\n\n$$m=\\frac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1}$$",
     "autoApply": true,
     "key": "theory|p8-formula-block",
